{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061470/block/singleImage/3254942/df/01M6CQR5YVEV9C936E3Q275CTT.jpg?updatedAt=1793579699\"/><figcaption>珍惜生命，黃大仙橫頭磡邨中年婦墮樓，昏迷送院不治。(Google Map)</figcaption></figure><p>黃大仙發生墮樓事件。今日(2日)凌晨4時許，警方接獲橫頭磡邨宏禮樓一名男子報案，指懷疑其45歲妻子由高處墮下。警方及救護車接報到場，於上址大廈平台對開位置發現女事主，她昏迷不醒，由救護車送往廣華醫院搶救，惜最終證實不治，警方經初步調查，相信女事主於住所墮樓，在現場未有檢獲遺書，墮樓原因仍在調查中，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T02:40:03.167424+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.406939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T02:38:11.408022+00:00","content_hash":"7f2b444a6a3ed33eef32a0b5b785677c454358229f9fb38bc8afc07592176fa4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T02:40:03.167424+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}